# PRODUCTION-GRADE SECURE PURCHASE SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

Ushbu loyihaviy yechim PostgreSQL va SQLAlchemy bazasida moliyaviy va obuna tranzaksiyalarining xavfsizligini, race condition hamda poyga holatlaridan to'liq muhofaza qilinishini ta'minlaydi.

---

## 1. ARXITEKTURA VA DATABASE SXEMASI (POSTGRESQL DDL)

Tizim uchta asosiy ustunga tayanadi:

1. **CHECK Constraint** — DB darajasida balans manfiyga tushishini taqiqlash.
2. **TIMESTAMPTZ (UTC)** — Barcha vaqt qiymatlarini vaqt mintaqasi bilan (Timezone-Aware UTC) saqlash.
3. **Idempotency Table & Unique Constraint** — Har bir xarid amalining takrorlanmasligini va bir xil idempotency kalitining foydalanuvchi doirasida izolyatsiyasini kafolatlash.

```sql
-- 1. Users jadvali
CREATE TABLE users (
    id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    telegram_id VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
    balance BIGINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK (balance >= 0),
    is_premium BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,
    premium_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

-- 2. Idempotent Purchases jadvali
CREATE TABLE purchases (
    id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    user_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    idempotency_key VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,
    price BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK (price > 0),
    status VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL CHECK (status IN ('PROCESSING', 'COMPLETED', 'FAILED')),
    response_payload JSONB NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    
    -- Takroriy idempotency kalitining bir foydalanuvchi doirasida izolyatsiyasi
    CONSTRAINT uq_user_idempotency UNIQUE (user_id, idempotency_key)
);

-- Baza samaradorligini oshirish uchun indekslar
CREATE INDEX idx_purchases_user_idempotency ON purchases(user_id, idempotency_key);
CREATE INDEX idx_users_telegram_id ON users(telegram_id);

```

